        "6407717640": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Really excited about this UI to React components platform. Definitely see a bright future!",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694418": {
          "variants": [{ "__ref": "3556323" }, { "__ref": "3556331" }],
          "args": [],
          "attrs": {},
          "rs": { "__ref": "4395694419" },
          "dataCond": null,
          "dataRep": null,
          "text": null,
          "columnsConfig": null,
          "__type": "VariantSetting"
        },
        "4395694419": {
          "values": {},
          "mixins": [],
          "__type": "RuleSet",
          "animations": null
        },
        "4395694420": {
          "variants": [{ "__ref": "3556331" }, { "__ref": "6065138" }],
          "args": [],
          "attrs": {},
          "rs": { "__ref": "4395694421" },
          "dataCond": null,
          "dataRep": null,
          "text": null,
          "columnsConfig": null,
          "__type": "VariantSetting"
        },
        "4395694421": {
          "values": {},
          "mixins": [],
          "__type": "RuleSet",
          "animations": null
        },
        "4395694423": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078686" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694425": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078687" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694426": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "After using this for about an hour, I'm convinced it's the future.",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694428": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078746" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694429": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Design Director\nOutdoorsy",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694430": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078747" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694433": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078752" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694434": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Partner\n8020",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694435": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078753" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694436": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Watching @yaaang demo quickly creating #react components with ease using his app @plasmicapp for the second time tonight at a @_collab_lab exclusive presentation. AND I’m just as blown away as I was last time! Check out this app, y’all!",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694438": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078843" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694439": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Front-End Engineer\nZapier",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694440": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078844" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694442": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078749" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694443": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Senior UX Designer\nCoupa Software",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694444": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078750" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694447": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078834" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694448": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Software Developer\nAPS Physics",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694449": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078835" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694451": { "tpl": [], "__type": "RenderExpr" },
        "4395694453": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078692" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694457": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "fellow UI engineers and designers, you should pay attention to what the folks over at @plasmicapp are doing. I've been using the beta and it is pretty excellent—this is certainly the future of component development.",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694459": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078689" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694461": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078690" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694463": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Software Engineer\nIntuit",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694464": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Software Engineer\nSidecar Health",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694466": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078840" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694468": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078841" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694474": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "We're totally blown away many times a day because of plasmic. You're doing god's work.",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694475": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "I was pleasantly surprised and at times, blown away, with the Plasmic approach to solving the problem. The whole concept of variants, interactive variants, and slots feels natural and intuitive.",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694476": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Plasmic is the most important app to be released in the last five years.",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694477": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "By far one of the most empowering tools to come out in a while. If you’re a designer/no coder/visual developer who wants to make world class applications, or a design or development studio looking for a way to serve your clients better and faster—check out Plasmic.",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694479": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078837" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694482": {
          "tpl": [{ "__ref": "1078838" }],
          "__type": "RenderExpr"
        },
        "4395694484": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Collin Thompson",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "4395694485": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "CEO\nIntrepid Ventures",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
